ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi233: GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET containing EDGE_LOOP forming figure-8 pattern on PLANE; PLANE: normal +Z, origin (0,0,0); pinch_v at origin (0,0,0) IS the shared junction vertex of two loops; left loop: (0,0,0)→(-5,0,0)→(-5,5,0)→(0,5,0)→(0,0,0) CCW orientation; right loop: (0,0,0)→(0,5,0)→(5,5,0)→(5,0,0)→(0,0,0) CW orientation; opposite orientations produce winding-number zero around any interior point; CheckOuterBound enclosing test IS inconclusive — cannot classify wire IS defect; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty; all EDGE_CURVEs ARE wired into EDGE_LOOP; never orphaned */
